-height: normal; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"text-decoration-line: underline; color: #333399;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-ansi-language: EN-GB;\">Qualification</span></strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n \t<li style=\"font-weight: 400; text-align: left;\" aria-level=\"1\"><b>Master of Computer Applications&nbsp;</b></li>\n \t<li style=\"font-weight: 400; text-align: left;\" aria-level=\"1\"><b>Bachelor of Computer Applications&nbsp; </b></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n<tbody>\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 0; mso-yfti-firstrow: yes; height: 22.45pt;\">\n<td style=\"width: 100.0%; border: solid black 1.0pt; mso-border-alt: solid black .5pt; background: #002060; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 22.45pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"100%\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; line-height: normal; text-align: center;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #ffffff;\">Areas of Interest</span></strong></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 1; height: 52.7pt;\">\n<td style=\"width: 100.0%; border: solid black 1.0pt; border-top: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid black .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid black .5pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 52.7pt;\" width=\"100%\">\n<ol>\n \t<li style=\"text-align: left;\">Machine Learning and Data Analysis using Python</li>\n \t<li style=\"text-align: left;\">Data Science using Python</li>\n</ol>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n<tbody>\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 0; mso-yfti-firstrow: yes; height: 22.45pt;\">\n<td style=\"width: 100.0%; border: solid black 1.0pt; mso-border-alt: solid black .5pt; background: #002060; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 22.45pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"100%\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; line-height: normal; text-align: center;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #ffffff;\">Fdps/Conferences/Workshops/Sttp/Mooc Certification</span></strong></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 1; height: 52.7pt;\">\n<td style=\"width: 100.0%; border: solid black 1.0pt; border-top: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid black .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid black .5pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 52.7pt;\" width=\"100%\">\n<ol>\n \t<li style=\"text-align: left;\">”Stepping into Practical aspects of Cyber Security Research” One week FDP</li>\n \t<li style=\"text-align: left;\">”Two Days Hands on Workshop on Microsoft Excel with AI and ChatGPT”</li>\n</ol>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n<tbody>\n<tr style=\"height: 22.45pt; text-align: justify;\">\n<td style=\"width: 100%; border-right: 1pt solid black; border-bottom: 1pt solid black; border-left: 1pt solid black; border-image: initial; border-top: none; background: #002060; padding: 0cm 5.4pt; height: 22.45pt; text-align: center;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"100%\"><span style=\"color: #ffffff;\"><strong><b>Roles and Responsibilities: Department Level</b></strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 22.45pt; text-align: justify;\">\n<td style=\"width: 100.0%; border: solid black 1.0pt; border-top: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid black .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid black .5pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 22.45pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"100%\">\n<ol>\n \t<li style=\"text-align: left;\">Academic Coordinator (BCA)</li>\n \t<li style=\"text-align: left;\">Mentoring Coordinator (MCA,BCA)</li>\n \t<li style=\"text-align: left;\">Research Coordinator(MCA)</li>\n \t<li style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: inherit;\">Technical Seminar Coordinator(MCA,BCA)</span></li>\n \t<li style=\"text-align: left;\">Internal Assessment Coordinator(MCA,BCA)</li>\n</ol>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>",
